  "description": "The stage: its position and status, moves, jogs, homing and stopping.\nA move whose invocation is cancelled stops the stage where it is, as\n`halt` does. While a hardware job runs, moves, jogs and homing are\nrefused as busy (409); `halt` and `clear_alarm` never are.",
  "forms": [
    {
      "href": "/api/v1/stage/properties",
      "op": [
        "readallproperties",
        "writemultipleproperties"
      ]
    },
    {
